<div class="wb-body wb-equipment-form wb-effect-form">
  <header class="wb-item-heading"><img class="wb-item-icon" src="{{effect.img}}" alt=""><div><span class="wb-eyebrow">{{#if form}}Form{{else}}{{#if itemBonus}}Bonus{{else}}Saved ability{{/if}}{{/if}}</span>
    <input class="wb-name" type="text" name="name" value="{{effect.name}}" aria-label="Name" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
  </div></header>
  <label>Source<input type="text" name="flags.worlds-beyond.source" value="{{source}}" placeholder="Ability, item or other source" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}></label>
  <div class="wb-section-heading"><h2 class="wb-section-title">Bonuses &amp; penalties</h2><button type="button" data-action="addBonus" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Add bonus</button></div>
  <div class="wb-effect-changes">
    {{#each rows}}
    <div class="wb-effect-change">
      {{#if editable}}
      <label>Changes<select name="effectRows.{{index}}.key" {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#each choices}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>
      <label>Amount<input type="number" name="effectRows.{{index}}.value" value="{{value}}" step="1" {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}></label>
      {{else}}<p class="wb-item-brief">{{text}} · edit in Foundry editor</p>{{/if}}
      <button type="button" class="wb-item-remove" data-action="removeBonus" data-index="{{index}}" aria-label="Remove bonus {{index}}" {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}><i class="fa-solid fa-trash-can" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
    </div>
    {{else}}<p class="wb-empty">No bonuses. Add one to adjust a stat or other value.</p>{{/each}}
  </div>
  <details class="wb-disclosure" data-sync="effect-notes"><summary>Notes &amp; image</summary>
    <label>Notes<textarea name="description" rows="4" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{effect.description}}</textarea></label>
    <label>Image path<input type="text" name="img" value="{{effect.img}}" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}></label>
  </details>
  <details class="wb-disclosure wb-help"><summary>Bonus help</summary>
    <p>Edits save automatically. Equipment bonuses apply while equipped; ability bonuses apply when you Use the ability, or while owned for Passive abilities. Consumable bonuses apply from their use card and end in Status. Positive amounts add; negative amounts subtract. Base scores and points spent stay unchanged. Final manual overrides still take priority.</p>
    <p>Saved abilities and forms from older sheets remain available under Abilities. Create new ones with Add ability or Add form there. Active bonuses appear in Status. The Foundry editor remains available for advanced native changes; those rows are preserved.</p>
    <button type="button" data-action="advancedEffect">Open Foundry editor</button>
  </details>
</div>
